---
description: SCL design system — tokens, typography, components, motion
globs: src/app/**/*.tsx,src/components/**/*.tsx,src/app/**/*.css
---

Follow `docs/SCL_DESIGN_CONTRACT.md` and `docs/SCL_COMPONENT_SYSTEM.md`.

- **Tokens only** (defined in `src/app/globals.css`). Foundation is `--scl-*` (ink ladder +
  Settlement Gold). Semantic aliases: `bg-background/card/surface-2/surface-3` (ink depth),
  `border`/`border-strong`, `brand`/`primary`/`gold`/`live` = **Settlement Gold** (CTAs,
  selection, verification, rank — scarce), `pos`/`neg` = graded wins/losses only, never
  decoration. Never raw hex or Tailwind palette colors (no `zinc-900` / pure `#000`).
- **Typography:** Barlow Condensed (display), Barlow (UI), IBM Plex Mono (data). Every odds /
  line / units / ROI / timestamp uses `.scl-data`. Eyebrows use `.scl-eyebrow`.
- **Build from SCL components** (`src/components/scl/*`): Ticket, StatBlock/StatPill, Roi/Unit/
  WinRate/Record stats, VerificationBadge, TrophyBadge, SportTag, StatusBadge,
  RankMovementIndicator, RecentFormStrip, CapperAvatar, LeaderboardRow/MobileCard, CapperCard,
  PickCard, SectionHeader, EmptyState, Skeleton*. Add new shared components here and document
  them.
- **shadcn = Base UI:** polymorphism is `render` (e.g. `<Button render={<Link href="/x" />}>`),
  never `asChild`. Add primitives via `npx shadcn@latest add`.
- **Mobile-first:** tables get a real mobile card variant (`hidden md:block` / `md:hidden`),
  tap targets ≥ 40px, no overflow at 375px.
- **States always:** loading (Skeleton*), empty (EmptyState), error (inline + toast).
- **Motion** is subtle + meaningful only (Ticket settle, rank/live/status/filter/reveal/
  skeleton); respect `prefers-reduced-motion`. No decorative orbs.
- Don't produce a default-shadcn / AI-template look — it must feel like SCL Ledger & Board.
